[00:00.00]Chinese Speech Contest December 24,
[00:03.52]2022 To enhance international students’ ability to speak Chinese and enrich after-class activities for them,
[00:14.19]the Student Union of Department of Chinese Language and Literature is organizing a school-wide Chinese speech contest for international students,
[00:28.51]which is to be held on Saturday next week (December 31) at the auditorium.
[00:35.44]Those who are interested in taking part in it may sign up with the monitor of their classes before Tuesday next week.
[00:46.34]Five prestigious professors from Peking University and Tsinghua University will be invited to be the honorable judges.
[00:57.93]The first six winners will be given awards.
[01:02.02]If the would-be candidates have any questions,
[01:06.56]please do not hesitate to contact us at the following address: studentunion@163.com.
[01:14.85]Everybody is welcome to be present at the contest.
